OL,3,GNEWSAMum urges 'culture change' over
OL,4,Aroad safety
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a six-year-old boy who
OL,7,Fwas killed when he was struck by a van
OL,8,Foutside his school has said there needs
OL,9,Fto be a "culture change" around road
OL,10,Fsafety.
OL,12,FJoanne Colleran, whose son Bobby died
OL,13,Fin Liverpool in 2014 said it felt like
OL,14,F"everyone is in a rush" but "it's so
OL,15,Fdangerous".
OL,17,FShe was speaking after Liverpool City
OL,18,FCouncil declared a road safety
OL,19,Femergency, and Tom Crone, leader of the
OL,20,FGreens on the authority, called for an
OL,21,Fextension of 20 mph (32 km/h) zones.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
